WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.000
- So, yesterday I went to
school and I wore my hair

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.030
in an Afro like this.

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:07.886
And, a lot of people
had a lot of mean things

00:00:07.886 --> 00:00:09.450
to say about it,

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:12.850
so, that made me feel some type of way.

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:14.571
I told my mom, and she said,

00:00:14.571 --> 00:00:18.620
"Promise, don't forget who
you are, and whose you are."

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:19.870
And I said, "Okay."

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:22.230
So today I'm gonna go to school

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:25.490
and I'm gonna come back bigger and better,

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:27.900
and don't let anyone steal your joy.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.211
Don't give them that much power.

00:00:30.211 --> 00:00:32.480
- I'm so proud of you, that's so cool

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:34.910
that you flipped it, you
turned it into a positive.

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.320
You turned it into
confidence, I love that.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.630
How did the kids react when
you went back the next day?

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:39.980
- They were kinda used to it,

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:42.277
but some people still were asking like,

00:00:42.277 --> 00:00:43.540
"Why are you wearing your hair like that?"

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:44.373
I was like--

00:00:44.373 --> 00:00:46.187
- Why you wearing your
hair like that, right?

00:00:46.187 --> 00:00:47.260
(audience laughing)

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:48.576
That's what I would say.

00:00:48.576 --> 00:00:49.510
I love it that.

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:51.400
Your video, though, has
inspired so many people,

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.920
including my guest,

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:53.790
my first guest, y'all,

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:56.160
she is a Golden Globe
Award winning actress,

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.690
and the star of Blackish.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.137
The last time I saw her she was singing,

00:00:59.137 --> 00:01:01.220
"A Moment Like This" at
the American Music Awards,

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:02.053
it was awesome.

00:01:02.053 --> 00:01:05.418
Say hello to Tracee Ellis Ross (clapping)

00:01:05.418 --> 00:01:09.225
(audience clapping and whooping)

00:01:09.225 --> 00:01:12.225
(upbeat soul music)

00:01:14.066 --> 00:01:15.399
- I almost fell!

00:01:18.152 --> 00:01:19.443
- Oh my god!

00:01:19.443 --> 00:01:22.553
- Look at Promise! Look at Promise!

00:01:22.553 --> 00:01:27.015
(audience clapping and screaming)

00:01:27.015 --> 00:01:28.287
She's so beautiful!

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:29.490
Promise, you're my dream!

00:01:29.490 --> 00:01:30.323
- Get up here!

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:31.156
- Promise, come here!

00:01:31.156 --> 00:01:31.989
- Get up here!

00:01:31.989 --> 00:01:32.822
- Come here!

00:01:32.822 --> 00:01:34.108
- Yes!

00:01:34.108 --> 00:01:37.201
(audience clapping and screaming)

00:01:37.201 --> 00:01:39.951
(Promise crying)

